  "body": "Stacked on #2027 (merge #2027 first)\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added five geometry tokens to `theme::Tokens` (`window_margin`, `status_h`, `ribbon_tab_pad_x`, `ribbon_tab_gap`, `ribbon_tab_stroke`) and `clamp::RADIUS_WINDOW` (`24`).\n- Updated `Tokens::DARK` and `Tokens::LIGHT` in `theme/tables.rs` with defaults that preserve existing dark and light pixel geometry (`6.0`, `22.0`, `12.0`, `2.0`, `2.0`).\n- Added `theme::status_h(t)` to return the maximum of `t.status_h`, `t.control_height + 4.0`, and `t.font_row * 1.3 + 4.0`.\n- Wired `Tokens::style()` to read `spacing.window_margin` from `self.window_margin` instead of `item_spacing_y.max(6.0)`.\n- Wired `shell::shell_layout` to size the bottom status bar with `theme::status_h(&pal)`.\n- Wired `panes::ribbon_tabs` to read left inset from `pal.item_spacing_x`, tab padding from `pal.ribbon_tab_pad_x`, inter-tab gap from `pal.ribbon_tab_gap`, and underline stroke from `pal.ribbon_tab_stroke`.\n- Wired `file_drop::paint_hint` to read border inset from `pal.window_margin`, corner radius from `pal.radius_window`, and stroke thickness and text size from `pal.font_label`.\n- Split `theme_files::names` into `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme_files/names.rs` to keep every file under 400 lines.\n- Added `docs/decisions/2064-theme-shell-metrics.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nShell metrics for window margin, bottom status height, ribbon tab spacing and stroke, and the file drop hint used hardcoded constants or `item_spacing_y` instead of dedicated theme tokens.\n\n## Tests\n\nAll five pinning tests failed before the fix on unchanged `base-2027` and pass after the final edit:\n\n- `theme_shell_metrics::window_margin_comes_from_own_token_not_item_spacing`\n- `theme_shell_metrics::status_h_and_ribbon_tab_keys_parse_and_clamp`\n- `egui_app::tests::ribbon_rows::issue_2064_pins::status_strip_height_tracks_theme_controls_and_status_h`\n- `egui_app::tests::ribbon_rows::issue_2064_pins::ribbon_tabs_follow_theme_spacing_pad_gap_and_stroke`\n- `egui_app::tests::file_drop::issue_2064_pins::drop_hint_reads_window_margin_radius_and_font_from_theme`\n\nMutation checks (each reverted or loosened code path failed red, then passed green after restoring):\n\n1. `theme.rs` `Tokens::style()` `window_margin` reverted to `item_spacing_y.max(6.0)` -> `window_margin_comes_from_own_token_not_item_spacing` failed, restored passed.\n2. `theme_files/overlay.rs` clamps on the 5 new keys loosened -> `status_h_and_ribbon_tab_keys_parse_and_clamp` failed, restored passed.\n3. `theme.rs` `status_h()` stripped to `t.status_h` -> `status_strip_height_tracks_theme_controls_and_status_h` failed, restored passed.\n4. `shell.rs` `.exact_size(22.0)`, `panes.rs` `ribbon_tabs` literals, and `file_drop.rs` `paint_hint` literals reverted -> all 3 `issue_2064_pins` tests failed, restored passed.\n\nGate and lint after final edit:\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`ui lib` 832 passed / 6 ignored, `boundary` 3, `boundary_picks` 6, `sinker_setup` 2, `theme_files` 14, `theme_shell_metrics` 2, `waterjet_tool` 1; 0 failed).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed with zero warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`0` `.nc`, `.cl`, or `.png` files changed).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `assets/themes/theme.json.example` was not updated here because #2038 creates that file on top of #2027 and this branch stacks one level on #2027.\n- Unchanged non-UI workspace crates and Windows-made pixel snapshot goldens did not run in the quick gate.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- `#2027` (stacked on it; merge `#2027` first): modifies `theme.rs` (`Tokens`, `clamp`, `geom_legal`), `theme/tables.rs`, `theme_files.rs` (`names`, `COLOR_NAMES`, `GEOM_NAMES`), `theme_files/overlay.rs` (`apply_overlay`), `shell.rs` (constants above `STATUS_H`), `panes.rs` (`ribbon_tabs`), and `tests/ribbon_rows.rs`.\n- `#2029`, `#2023`, `#1798`, `#1330` touch other functions in `shell.rs`; `#1798` touches other functions in `panes.rs`. Whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: Read status strip height, ribbon tab metrics, window margin, and drop hint geometry from theme tokens\nFixes #2064\n\n## Review screenshots\n\nThese screenshots show the actual shell, tool editor, and file drop hint.\nThe renderer uses `egui_kittest` and the actual `View3D` GPU output at 1440 × 960 pixels.\nThe ribbon and status images are crops of that output.\n\nBoth runs use the same dark theme and scene.\nThe theme sets `window_margin=20`, `status_h=48`, `ribbon_tab_pad_x=24`, `ribbon_tab_gap=12`, and `ribbon_tab_stroke=6`.\nIt also sets `item_spacing_x=16`, `radius_window=20`, and `font_label=15`.\nThese values make the changed behavior visible. The default values preserve the previous geometry.\n\nThe after run uses the consumers at `bacb784b0207c43ea610bb8da9c8beb15f9ba61b`.\nFor the before run, the temporary harness restores the parent ribbon tab function, status height, window margin expression, and drop hint body.\nThe before run keeps the new token schema to load the same theme file.\nIt keeps an unused palette argument on the drop hint function so the harness compiles.\nThus, the before run shows the parent consumer behavior with the same theme configuration.\nIt does not use an unchanged parent checkout.\n\nThe eight PNG files exist only on the fork's `pr-screenshots` branch.\nNo screenshot, capture harness, log, or review evidence was added to this PR branch.\n\n### Status strip\n\n![Status strip: before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/b2dad955c2be0593f0212e4bf223e7242b46ea0a/2091/status-strip-before.png)\n\n![Status strip: after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/b2dad955c2be0593f0212e4bf223e7242b46ea0a/2091/status-strip-after.png)\n\n### Ribbon tabs\n\n![Ribbon tabs: before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/b2dad955c2be0593f0212e4bf223e7242b46ea0a/2091/ribbon-tabs-before.png)\n\n![Ribbon tabs: after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/b2dad955c2be0593f0212e4bf223e7242b46ea0a/2091/ribbon-tabs-after.png)\n\n### Window margin\n\n![Window margin: before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/b2dad955c2be0593f0212e4bf223e7242b46ea0a/2091/window-margin-before.png)\n\n![Window margin: after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/b2dad955c2be0593f0212e4bf223e7242b46ea0a/2091/window-margin-after.png)\n\n### File drop hint\n\n![File drop hint: before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/b2dad955c2be0593f0212e4bf223e7242b46ea0a/2091/file-drop-hint-before.png)\n\n![File drop hint: after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/b2dad955c2be0593f0212e4bf223e7242b46ea0a/2091/file-drop-hint-after.png)\n\n",
